BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Montclair State University
CATEGORIES:Athletics
DESCRIPTION:July 7th\, 8th and 9th\n$30 Student\; $75 Faculty/Staff\nJoin 
 Campus Recreation for a new and exciting trip where we will camp in the b
 eautiful Wharton State Forest and surf on the beaches of Ocean City\, NJ!
  We will head to Wharton State Forest for a relaxing night of camping. Th
 e next day we will head to Ocean City to enjoy the sun and waves. We retu
 rn to the campsite that evening\, and depart Thursday morning to come bac
 k to campus. We provide all of the equipment and transportation\, includi
 ng tents\, sleeping bags\, ground pads\, surfing lessons and surfboards\,
  plus beach badges for the afternoon! Meals are included.\n  How do I Sig
 n-up?\n\nRegister online through Fusion\, in the Student Rec Center main 
 office\, or over the phone (973-655-3340).\nCost for Students $30\; Facul
 ty/Staff $75\n\n Where and When?\n\nJuly 7th\, 8th and 9th\, 2026\nJuly 7
 th 10 am- July 9th 5pm \nBegins at Student Recreation Center\n\nWhat to b
 ring: Water bottle\, bug spray\, sunscreen\, towel\, bathing suit\, cloth
 es for 2 nights and 3 days\, toiletries\, chargers\, bag for wet clothing
 \, sneakers\, money (optional for boardwalk)\nPotential Hazards: Unpredic
 table weather changes\, sunburn/heat exhaustion\, dehydration\, allergic 
 reactions/poisonous plants\, insect bites\, falls from a height\, abrasio
 ns from sand\, uncontrolled interactions with wildlife\, drowning from ro
 ugh surf. \n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdditional Information can 
 be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12490305
DTEND:20260709T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260708T031441Z
DTSTART:20260707T140000Z
LOCATION:Meet at the Student Recreation Center
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Camping and Surfing Trip
UID:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12490305
URL:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12490305
X-HOSTS:Campus Recreation
END:VEVENT
