  casual games and friendly competition. \nHow do I Sign-up?\n\nRegistrati
 on is not required.\nFREE for students with a Valid Montclair State ID\n\
 nWhere and When?\n\nMonday\, July 13\n5 - 7 p.m.\nStudent Recreation Cent
 er - Gym\n\n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdditional Information can 
 be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12494880
